=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Kanabec County has 75 years of record on its 8 grids, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 35 years, and in 2025 it came in at 44% of normal. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, with grids 30746 and 30747 down to 46% of normal that year.</p>"}
